# Floating table of contents

The publication reader uses **one** ToC UX on phone, tablet, and desktop:

- Quiet FAB at the bottom-right over the reading pane
- Open panel is `position: fixed` (`.toc` / `.toc-open`), not in the document flow
- Same behavior at every breakpoint

## Do not

- Add `@media (min-width: …)` rules that set `.toc { position: sticky; top: … }` or move the ToC into a sidebar column on wide screens
- Treat “fixed ToC on desktop” as a bug — it is intentional (see `features/layout/mobile_first.feature`)

## Do

- Keep desktop and mobile ToC markup/CSS aligned
- Prefer polishing the floating panel over reintroducing a dual layout
